Place your downloaded qwen3.5-4B-Q4_K_M.gguf (or whichever quant you're
using) directly in this directory. GGUF files are gitignored here — this
placeholder just keeps the directory itself present in a fresh clone.

See docker-compose-hindsight.yml and .env-example's HINDSIGHT_LLM_* section
for how this directory is mounted and which filename is expected by default.
